      "page": 489,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4330,
      "text": "Should We then turn the Reminder[3] away from you simply because you are a transgressing people?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 489,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4331,
      "text": "How many a prophet did We send to the earlier peoples!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 489,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4332,
      "text": "No prophet ever came to them except that they ridiculed him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 489,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4333,
      "text": "So We destroyed them, although they were greater in might than these [Pagans][4], and the stories of the earlier nations have already been related[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 489,
      "ruku": 424,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4334,
      "text": "If you ask them, “Who created the heavens and earth?”, they will surely say, “The All-Mighty, the All-Knowing created them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
